{"id":"ehsse","lemma":"эссе","pos":"noun","rank":4403,"glosses":["essay"],"gender":"n","examples":[{"text":"Я написала эссе.","en":"I wrote an essay.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to write","l":"написать"},null]},{"text":"Я должен был работать над эссе.","en":"I had to work on an essay.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"above, over"},null]},{"text":"Том помог мне написать это эссе.","en":"Tom helped me write this essay.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to write"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Его эссе было кратким и по делу.","en":"His essay was concise and to the point.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"along / by"},null]},{"text":"Напиши короткое эссе.","en":"Write a short essay.","words":[{"g":"to write","l":"написать"},{"g":"short, brief","l":"короткий"},null]}]}